      "message": "\u003e One non-blocking question: Skia\u0027s DEPS pins third_party/externals/expat at R_2_7_4+38, so Skia\u0027s own bots only compile the old branches. Do you plan to roll expat to R_2_9_0 in a follow-up, so the new branches get build coverage here too?\n\nYes, I plan to roll third_party/externals/expat to R_2_9_0 in a follow-up once this lands. That\u0027s the same revision Chromium is moving to in https://crrev.com/c/8683200. The roll also needs the new xcs.c/xcs.h sources in the GN and Bazel builds and an updated expat_config.h, so I\u0027d rather keep it separate. In the meantime, the new branches get build coverage in Chromium\u0027s Android, Windows and Mac builds, which use the in-tree expat, once both changes reach Chromium.",
